      "title": "Clinical Instructor/Clinical Assistant Professor/Clinical Associate Professor/Clinical Professor/Teaching Assistant Professor/Teaching Associate Professor/Teaching Professor/Research Assistant Professor/Research Associate Professor/Research Professor",
